wh40k-footfall-market-borsgrant-name = Bors Grant
wh40k-footfall-market-borsgrant-desc = A construction materials supplier at the exchange.
wh40k-footfall-market-borsgrant-marker = Spawner: Bors Grant
wh40k-footfall-market-borsgrant-title = Grant Building Supplies
wh40k-footfall-market-borsgrant-intro = If you need a wall, start with steel. If you need the promise of a wall, ask the person with the work schedule. I sell actual packs.
wh40k-footfall-market-borsgrant-info = Steel, glass, plastic, wood, rods, cloth and cardboard come in fifty-unit packs; floor tiles in packs of thirty. Stock is large but shared. No gold or expensive wonders: the wall does not need them.
wh40k-footfall-market-borsgrant-farewell = Come back once the wall is finished. Ordering the next one first is a favourite customer mistake.
wh40k-footfall-market-borsgrant-menu = Would you like the stock or some advice?
ent-MobWH40KFootfallBorsGrant = { wh40k-footfall-market-borsgrant-name }
