wh40k-footfall-market-neraquinn-desc = A communications and instrument vendor at the exchange.
wh40k-footfall-market-neraquinn-marker = Spawner: Nera Quinn
wh40k-footfall-market-neraquinn-title = Quinn Vox and Instruments
wh40k-footfall-market-neraquinn-intro = Got a signal? Good. Then we can discuss how quickly that changes without spare power.
wh40k-footfall-market-neraquinn-info = Imperial vox sets and their keys, high-capacity cells, portable radios, radiation meters and navigators. Working instruments, not a promise of eternal reception: they cannot fix power or conditions for you.
wh40k-footfall-market-neraquinn-farewell = Stay in touch. Silence is elegant only until the first search party.
wh40k-footfall-market-neraquinn-menu = Would you like the stock or some advice?
