wh40k-footfall-market-brokeshopper-desc = A visitor browsing the market.
wh40k-footfall-market-brokeshopper-marker = Spawner: broke visitor
wh40k-footfall-market-brokeshopper-line-1 = I have visited every stall. Still no money, but I know all the prices by heart.
wh40k-footfall-market-brokeshopper-line-2 = Sat down to total my expenses. A fine bench: the only thing I can afford today.
wh40k-footfall-market-brokeshopper-line-3 = My wallet is light. The sellers call that freedom of choice, but the choice seems light too.
