wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyerone-desc = A shopper at the exchange.
wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyerone-marker = Spawner: shopper with a long list
wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyerone-line-1 = Came for one thing. Now I have half a page of shopping and still lack that one thing.
wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyerone-line-2 = First I will check every price. Then return to the first and pretend it was always my choice.
wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyerone-line-3 = Stare at a counter long enough and the seller starts believing you are rich. That is my strategy so far.
