wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyertwo-marker = Spawner: practical shopper
wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyertwo-line-1 = Everything looks essential in the display. In the backpack, the essential thing turns out to have been free space.
wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyertwo-line-2 = I want gear that gets me home. I have already tried looking impressive on departure.
wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyertwo-line-3 = The seller suggests one more instrument. First I will ask who carries the others.
