wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyerthree-marker = Spawner: window shopper
wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyerthree-line-1 = I am not hesitating. I am giving the purchase time to become truly necessary.
wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyerthree-line-2 = Lovely coat. Now to convince the old one it is worn out and my wallet that I deserve it.
wh40k-footfall-market-marketbuyerthree-line-3 = Looking is still free. I am enjoying the last stable price on Footfall.
