wh40k-footfall-market-kass-intro = Keep it down. Ordinary goods are in the machines. These are things to ask about before a patrol does.
wh40k-footfall-market-kass-menu = Want the goods, or shall we first agree this conversation never happened?
wh40k-footfall-market-kass-info = Sequencer, jammer, heretical vox and keys, questionable medicine and a cloak for people who dislike questions. Provenance is discussed quietly; prices stay on the counter. I do not sell immunity.
wh40k-footfall-market-kass-farewell = Consider this a conversation about the weather. Today it is particularly unsuitable for written reports.
